        "description": "KMS key policy grants cross-account access without protective conditions. External principals can use this key to decrypt data.",
        "action": "Add kms:CallerAccount or aws:PrincipalOrgID conditions to cross-account statements. Restrict kms:ViaService to the specific services that require cross-account key access. Remove statements that grant broad cross-account access.",
        "example": "{\n  \"cryptography\": {\n    \"kind\": \"key\",\n    \"policy\": {\n      \"has_broad_cross_account\": false\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
